# Generated header-dependency files (PROBER_EMIT_DEPS=1 / verify-impact
# --regen-deps). Build output that verify-impact regenerates on demand to compute
# header fanout, so committing them would only ever go stale against the tree.
*.d
t/*_test
/.build/
ci/prober/coverage-map.json

# Landing dir for the consumer-wiring exercise: copies of our own modules are
# built and probed here, never committed. See
# memory/labs/nginx-test-harness/plan-wire-own-modules.md -- the copies are a
# measurement fixture, and the modules' own repos are the source of truth.
/consumers/
